<title>CHINA: China Jan-Sept fuel oil output down 18.53 percent.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Sept fuel oil output down 18.53 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's fuel oil output totalled 17.22 million tonnes in the first nine months of 1996, down 18.53 percent compared with the same period of last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Fuel oil output in September alone was 1.70 million tonnes, the bureau said.</p>
</text>
